{
	"id": "inventory",
	"node": "inventory",
	"credential": {
		"name": "inventoryApi",
		"properties": ["apiKey"],
		"data": {
			"apiKey": "{{secret}}"
		},
		"secretPrefix": "stk_"
	},
	"prompt": [
		"Build an n8n node for the Inventory API. Read its docs first: `curl -s http://127.0.0.1:18090/inventory/docs`.",
		"The API runs locally. Use the sandbox key from the docs for your tests.",
		"",
		"A grader checks these names exactly:",
		"- Node name `inventory`, display name \"Inventory\".",
		"- Credential name `inventoryApi` with one field `apiKey` (a password field). The credential sends the key the way the docs say.",
		"- Operation `item.create` (\"Create an item\"). Fields: `kind` (one of `physical`, `digital`; default `physical`), `sku` (string, required), `name` (string, required).",
		"  For `physical` also: `weightGrams`, `lengthCm`, `widthCm`, `heightCm` (numbers). For `digital` also: `downloadUrl` (string).",
		"  Send the body that the docs give for the kind, with no field of the other kind. Emit the created item exactly as the API returns it.",
		"  Do not validate field values in the node: the API validates them.",
		"  When the API answers 422, fail with the message `Invalid item: ` and then each entry of `errors` as `<field>: <message>`, joined with `; ` (for example `Invalid item: sku: must be ...; name: is required`).",
		"  When the node is set to continue on fail, emit one item `{ \"error\": \"<that message>\" }` for an input item that fails, and go on with the next input item.",
		"",
		"{{format}}",
		"",
		"Work in the current directory. Dependencies are installed: do not install packages. Do not ask questions.",
		"Stop when the node builds, passes the format checks, and works against the API."
	],
	"cases": [
		{
			"id": "create-physical",
			"operation": "item.create",
			"input": {
				"kind": "physical",
				"sku": "MUG-001",
				"name": "Coffee mug",
				"weightGrams": 350,
				"lengthCm": 12,
				"widthCm": 9,
				"heightCm": 10.5
			},
			"expect": {
				"items": [
					{
						"id": "itm_001",
						"kind": "physical",
						"sku": "MUG-001",
						"name": "Coffee mug",
						"weight": {
							"value": 350,
							"unit": "g"
						},
						"dimensions": {
							"length": 12,
							"width": 9,
							"height": 10.5,
							"unit": "cm"
						},
						"status": "active",
						"createdAt": "2026-04-01T12:00:00.000Z"
					}
				],
				"requests": {
					"method": "POST",
					"path": "/inventory/v1/items",
					"body": {
						"kind": "physical",
						"sku": "MUG-001",
						"name": "Coffee mug",
						"weight": {
							"value": 350,
							"unit": "g"
						},
						"dimensions": {
							"length": 12,
							"width": 9,
							"height": 10.5,
							"unit": "cm"
						}
					},
					"count": 1
				}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "create-digital",
			"operation": "item.create",
			"input": {
				"kind": "digital",
				"sku": "EBOOK-7",
				"name": "Field guide",
				"downloadUrl": "https://files.example.com/guide.pdf"
			},
			"expect": {
				"items": [
					{
						"id": "itm_001",
						"kind": "digital",
						"sku": "EBOOK-7",
						"name": "Field guide",
						"downloadUrl": "https://files.example.com/guide.pdf",
						"status": "active",
						"createdAt": "2026-04-01T12:00:00.000Z"
					}
				],
				"requests": {
					"method": "POST",
					"path": "/inventory/v1/items",
					"body": {
						"kind": "digital",
						"sku": "EBOOK-7",
						"name": "Field guide",
						"downloadUrl": "https://files.example.com/guide.pdf"
					},
					"count": 1
				}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "invalid-422",
			"operation": "item.create",
			"input": {
				"kind": "physical",
				"sku": "mug 1",
				"name": "Mug",
				"weightGrams": 0,
				"lengthCm": 12,
				"widthCm": 9,
				"heightCm": 10
			},
			"expect": {
				"error": true,
				"errorMessage": "Invalid item: sku: must be 3 to 32 characters from A-Z, 0-9 and -; weight.value: must be greater than 0",
				"requests": {
					"method": "POST",
					"path": "/inventory/v1/items",
					"body": {
						"kind": "physical",
						"sku": "mug 1",
						"name": "Mug",
						"weight": {
							"value": 0,
							"unit": "g"
						},
						"dimensions": {
							"length": 12,
							"width": 9,
							"height": 10,
							"unit": "cm"
						}
					},
					"count": 1
				}
			}
		},
		{
			"id": "continue-on-fail",
			"operation": "item.create",
			"continueOnFail": true,
			"input": {
				"kind": "digital",
				"sku": "EBOOK-9",
				"name": "Guide",
				"downloadUrl": "http://files.example.com/guide.pdf"
			},
			"expect": {
				"items": [
					{
						"error": "Invalid item: downloadUrl: must be an https URL"
					}
				],
				"requests": {
					"method": "POST",
					"path": "/inventory/v1/items",
					"body": {
						"kind": "digital",
						"sku": "EBOOK-9",
						"name": "Guide",
						"downloadUrl": "http://files.example.com/guide.pdf"
					},
					"count": 1
				}
			}
		}
	]
}
